    "properties": {
      "alertRuleTemplateName": null,
      "description": "This rule will help to detect if there is a Beacon Object File out there which can be used to directly request Entra ID access tokens from an active beacon on a device using a specific User Agent, we can easily detect this beacon file by flagging the funny user agent and / or scope identifier that is used",
